{
  "uid": "lab-argocd-gitops",
  "title": "Lab — ArgoCD (GitOps)",
  "tags": ["lab", "argocd", "gitops"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "About ArgoCD (GitOps)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Lab — ArgoCD (GitOps)\n\nReal-time view of the ArgoCD GitOps engine. Metrics come from four Alloy scrape targets already configured in `observability-alloy.yaml`:\n\n- `argocd-metrics` → `argocd-application-controller-metrics.argocd.svc:8082` (per-app sync/reconcile state)\n- `argocd-server-metrics` → `argocd-server-metrics.argocd.svc:8083`\n- `argocd-repo-server` → `argocd-repo-server-metrics.argocd.svc:8084` (git request latency)\n- `argocd-applicationset-controller` → `argocd-applicationset-controller-metrics.argocd.svc:8080`\n\nAll panels use real ArgoCD / KSM / cAdvisor metrics (ADR-0004 — no fabricated data)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "stat", "title": "Server Pod Running",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "max(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"argocd\", pod=~\"argocd-server-.*\", phase=\"Running\"})", "instant": true }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] },
          "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "text": "UP" } } }],
          "noValue": "not deployed"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "stat", "title": "App Controller Pod Running",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "max(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"argocd\", pod=~\"argocd-application-controller-.*\", phase=\"Running\"})", "instant": true }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] },
          "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "text": "UP" } } }],
          "noValue": "not deployed"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "stat", "title": "Repo Server Pod Running",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "max(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"argocd\", pod=~\"argocd-repo-server-.*\", phase=\"Running\"})", "instant": true }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] },
          "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "text": "UP" } } }],
          "noValue": "not deployed"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "stat", "title": "AppSet Controller Pod Running",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "max(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"argocd\", pod=~\"argocd-applicationset-controller-.*\", phase=\"Running\"})", "instant": true }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] },
          "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "text": "UP" } } }],
          "noValue": "not deployed"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 6, "type": "stat", "title": "Total Apps",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "count(argocd_app_info)", "instant": true }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "value" }, "noValue": "0" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 7, "type": "stat", "title": "Apps Healthy",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "count(argocd_app_info{health_status=\"Healthy\"})", "instant": true }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 8, "type": "stat", "title": "Apps Synced",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "count(argocd_app_info{sync_status=\"Synced\"})", "instant": true }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "color": { "mode": "value" }, "noValue": "0" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 9, "type": "stat", "title": "ArgoCD Memory (MiB)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "sum(container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"argocd\", container!=\"\"}) / 1024 / 1024", "instant": true }],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "decimals": 1, "noValue": "n/a" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "id": 10, "type": "table", "title": "Per-app sync state (argocd_app_info)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "argocd_app_info", "instant": true, "format": "table" }],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "Value": true, "__name__": true, "job": true, "instance": true, "dest_server": true, "namespace": true, "operation": true, "autosync_enabled": true }, "renameByName": { "name": "Application", "health_status": "Health", "sync_status": "Sync", "project": "Project", "repo": "Repo", "dest_namespace": "Target Namespace" } } }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 11, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Sync attempt rate by phase",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "sum(rate(argocd_app_sync_total[5m])) by (phase)", "legendFormat": "{{phase}}", "range": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 12, "type": "heatmap", "title": "Reconcile duration heatmap (argocd_app_reconcile_bucket)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "sum(rate(argocd_app_reconcile_bucket[5m])) by (le)", "format": "heatmap", "legendFormat": "{{le}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 2,
        "color": { "exponent": 0.5, "fill": "dark-orange", "mode": "scheme", "scheme": "Oranges", "steps": 64 },
        "exemplars": { "color": "rgba(255,0,255,0.7)" },
        "filterValues": { "le": 1e-9 },
        "legend": { "show": true },
        "rowsFrame": { "layout": "auto" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "showColorScale": false, "yHistogram": false },
        "yAxis": { "axisPlacement": "left", "reverse": false, "unit": "s" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Repo-server git request latency (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(argocd_git_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))", "legendFormat": "p50", "range": true },
        { "refId": "B", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(argocd_git_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))", "legendFormat": "p95", "range": true },
        { "refId": "C", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(argocd_git_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))", "legendFormat": "p99", "range": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 14, "type": "timeseries", "title": "ApplicationSet controller reconcile rate",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "rate(controller_runtime_reconcile_total{job=\"argocd-applicationset-controller\"}[5m])", "legendFormat": "{{result}}", "range": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 15, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Memory usage by container",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 39 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "sum by (container) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"argocd\", container!=\"\"})", "legendFormat": "{{container}}", "range": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 16, "type": "timeseries", "title": "CPU usage by container (millicores)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 39 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "sum by (container) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"argocd\", container!=\"\"}[5m])) * 1000", "legendFormat": "{{container}}", "range": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "none", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    }
  ]
}
